@prefix :     <http://example.org/odp#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

Here is the ontology design pattern you asked for:

:EvaluationRequest a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Evaluation Request" ;
    rdfs:comment "A request to evaluate whether an action should be permitted." .

:requestedAction a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :EvaluationRequest ;
    rdfs:range :Action

:requestingParty a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :EvaluationRequest ;
    rdfs:range :Par
